<!DOCTYPE html>
<html class="dark" style="background:#050505" lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"/>
<script id="sds-theme-resolver">/* Pre-paint theme resolver — must stay the first script in <head>. Stamps data-theme on <html> from the stored choice before anything paints, and overwrites the inline dark background attribute. Dark is the brand default when nothing is stored, so a visitor whose OS prefers light still gets the site's intended look until they choose. */(function(){var d=document.documentElement,t;try{t=localStorage.getItem("sds-theme")}catch(e){}if(t!=="light")t="dark";d.setAttribute("data-theme",t);d.classList.toggle("dark",t==="dark");d.style.background=t==="light"?"#f4f2ee":"#050505"})();</script>

<script>/* Head-stamp: nav.css reveals un-stamped pages at 0.2s (its no-logo-script fallback). On heavy pages the bottom-of-body surette-logo.js stamp lands after that, so content flashed in at 0.2s, vanished when the stamp arrived, then faded back in. Stamping before first paint makes JS the only revealer. */document.documentElement.classList.add("sds-logo-loaded");</script>
<style id="dm-critical-dark-baseline">
  html,body{background:#050505;color:#fff;min-height:100%;color-scheme:dark;}
  body{margin:0;min-height:100vh;}
  #__next,#root,.app{background:#050505;min-height:100vh;}
  body>main{min-height:100vh;}
  #page-loader,.sds-apps-loader{background:#050505;}
html[data-theme="light"],html[data-theme="light"] body{background:#f4f2ee;color:#0b0e10;color-scheme:light}html[data-theme="light"] #__next,html[data-theme="light"] #root,html[data-theme="light"] .app{background:#f4f2ee}html[data-theme="light"] #page-loader,html[data-theme="light"] .sds-apps-loader{background:#f4f2ee}
</style>
